        "kind": "photo",
        "src": "eternity-render.webp",
        "focus": {
          "x": 0.5,
          "y": 0.5,
          "k": 1.3
        },
        "label": "Total carat weight"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Karat with a K is gold purity, not gem weight.",
